const WX={'Suena el despertador':'dawn','El pronóstico anuncia lluvia':'rain','Se hace la tarde':'dusk','Viento fuerte':'wind','Neblina':'fog','Crecida':'rain','Tormenta':'storm','Se ve humo':'fire','Ola de calor':'heat','Madrugada con helada':'frost','Camino de barro':'rain','Se acerca la noche':'night','Soplan vientos':'wind'};
EV.forEach(e=>{const k=Object.keys(WX).find(k=>e.q.startsWith(k));e.w=k?WX[k]:'day'});
const ZB={U:'bosque',P:'pastizal',L:'humedal',E:'arbustal',R:'bosque',C:'sierras',A:'sierras',H:'humedal',M:'arbustal'};
const ZA={U:'#8aa0b5',P:'#d4a64a',L:'#4f9aa8',E:'#b98a4a',R:'#5b8fb8',C:'#b9704a',A:'#8fb4e0',H:'#d9748f',M:'#d98a3a'};
const ZT={U:'',P:'',L:'',E:'#d9b36a',R:'#6fa8c9',C:'#c98a5a',A:'#a9c7f0',H:'#e79ab0',M:'#e8a050'};
const ZIMG=(k,w)=>`url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,${IMG[(w==='dusk'||w==='dawn')?'ocaso':ZB[k]]})`;

const RR=(a,b)=>a+Math.random()*(b-a);
function fxHTML(w){let h='';const rep=(n,f)=>{for(let k=0;k<n;k++)h+=f(k)};
 if(w==='rain'||w==='storm'){
  rep(3,k=>`<i class="nube" style="left:${-20+k*35}%;--d:${RR(18,30).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,15).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`);
  rep(w==='storm'?44:30,()=>`<i class="gota" style="left:${RR(-5,110).toFixed(1)}%;--l:${RR(14,30).toFixed(0)}px;--v:${RR(.5,.85).toFixed(2)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,1).toFixed(2)}s;opacity:${RR(.4,.9).toFixed(2)}"></i>`);
  rep(9,()=>`<i class="chap" style="left:${RR(2,92).toFixed(0)}%;bottom:${RR(4,38).toFixed(0)}px;animation-delay:-${RR(0,1.1).toFixed(2)}s"></i>`);
  if(w==='storm'){let x=0,p='M'+RR(30,70).toFixed(0)+' 0';for(let y=1;y<=7;y++){x=RR(-12,12);p+=' l'+x.toFixed(0)+' '+(RR(8,13)).toFixed(0)}
   h+=`<svg class="rayo" style="left:${RR(15,70).toFixed(0)}%" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="60"><path d="${p}"/></svg>`}}
 else if(w==='wind'){const C=['#c9a15a','#a3874a','#7d9a4f','#d8c08a','#8a6b3a'];
  rep(16,()=>`<u class="hoja" style="top:${RR(8,88).toFixed(0)}%;--d:${RR(2.8,5.2).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,5).toFixed(1)}s"><b style="--s:${RR(7,12).toFixed(0)}px;--c:${C[Math.floor(Math.random()*5)]};--w:${RR(.9,1.7).toFixed(1)}s"></b></u>`);
  rep(4,k=>`<svg class="sop" viewBox="0 0 200 40" style="--x:${RR(2,62).toFixed(0)}%;--y:${(14+k*22).toFixed(0)}%"><path pathLength="1" style="--dl:${(k*.7).toFixed(1)}s" d="M0 22 C40 2 80 42 120 20 S178 8 198 24"/></svg>`)}
 else if(w==='fog'){rep(5,k=>`<i class="bruma" style="top:${(k*17+4)}%;--d:${RR(14,26).toFixed(0)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,14).toFixed(0)}s;opacity:${RR(.55,.95).toFixed(2)}"></i>`)}
 else if(w==='heat'){h+='<i class="sol"></i>';rep(7,()=>`<i class="vapor" style="left:${RR(2,96).toFixed(0)}%;--d:${RR(3,5).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,4).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`)}
 else if(w==='frost'){rep(26,()=>`<i class="cris" style="left:${RR(0,100).toFixed(0)}%;--s:${RR(2,4.5).toFixed(1)}px;--d:${RR(5,10).toFixed(1)}s;--p:${RR(1.4,3).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,9).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`)}
 else if(w==='fire'){h+='<i class="llama"></i>';rep(4,k=>`<i class="humo" style="left:${k*22}%;--d:${RR(5,8).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,6).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`);
  rep(22,()=>`<i class="brasa" style="left:${RR(0,100).toFixed(0)}%;--s:${RR(2,4.5).toFixed(1)}px;--dx:${RR(-30,50).toFixed(0)}px;--d:${RR(2,4.2).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,4).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`)}
 else if(w==='night'){h+='<i class="luna"></i><i class="fugaz"></i>';
  rep(30,()=>`<i class="est" style="left:${RR(2,98).toFixed(0)}%;top:${RR(3,55).toFixed(0)}%;--t:${RR(1.4,3.4).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,3).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`);
  rep(8,()=>`<i class="luci" style="left:${RR(5,92).toFixed(0)}%;top:${RR(52,88).toFixed(0)}%;--d:${RR(6,11).toFixed(0)}s;--p:${RR(1.6,3).toFixed(1)}s;animation-delay:-${RR(0,6).toFixed(1)}s"></i>`)}
 else if(w==='dusk'){h+='<i class="sol2"></i>'}
 else if(w==='dawn'){h+='<i class="sol3"></i>'}
 return h}
function escena(zk,w,sub,grande){
 return `<div class="esc w-${w}${grande?' grande':''}"><div class="bg" style="background-image:${ZIMG(zk,w)}"></div>${ZT[zk]?`<div class="zt" style="background:${ZT[zk]}"></div>`:''}<div class="fx">${fxHTML(w)}</div><div class="fx2">${w==='storm'?'':''}</div><div class="cap">${(G&&G.lugar&&zk===G.lugar.z)?G.lugar.n:''}<span>${sub||''}</span></div></div>`}
let SND=true,AC=null;
function tono(f,t0,d,tipo){try{AC=AC||new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();const o=AC.createOscillator(),g=AC.createGain(),t=AC.currentTime+t0;o.type=tipo||'triangle';o.frequency.value=f;g.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,t);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.18,t+.02);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,t+d);o.connect(g);g.connect(AC.destination);o.start(t);o.stop(t+d+.05)}catch(e){}}
const sonar=m=>{if(SND)(m?[523,659,784,1047,1319]:[523,659,784]).forEach((f,k)=>tono(f,k*.11,.3))};
const latido=()=>{if(SND){tono(110,0,.18,'sine');tono(110,.22,.18,'sine')}};
function revelar(ids){if(window.SIMULA||!ids.length)return;let k=0;
 const sig=()=>{if(k>=ids.length)return;const i=ids[k++],mit=SP[i][4]<.05,ov=document.createElement('div');ov.className='ov'+(mit?' mit':'');document.body.appendChild(ov);
  ov.innerHTML=`<div class="rayos"></div><div class="ojo"></div><p class="susp">${mit?'Pará. No te muevas…':'Algo se mueve entre las ramas…'}</p>`;
  latido();const hb=setInterval(latido,mit?650:900);let hecho=false,tt;
  const rev=()=>{if(hecho)return;hecho=true;clearInterval(hb);clearTimeout(tt);sonar(mit);cantoReal(i);
   let ch='';for(let n=0;n<26;n++){const a=Math.random()*6.283,r=90+Math.random()*150;ch+=`<i class="chispa" style="--x:${Math.cos(a)*r}px;--y:${Math.sin(a)*r}px;--dl:${(.25+Math.random()*.3).toFixed(2)}s"></i>`}
   ov.innerHTML=`<div class="rayos"></div>${ch}<p class="grito">${mit?'¡Increíble!':'¡Rara!'}</p>${figu(i,0)}<p class="dato2">${mit?'Casi nadie la ve: aparece':'Aparece'} en solo el <b>${pc(SP[i][4])}</b> de las listas de eBird en Córdoba.</p>${cantoCred(i)}<button class="btn">${k<ids.length?'Seguir':'¡La anoto!'}</button>`;
   ov.querySelector('.btn:last-of-type').onclick=()=>{cantoStop();ov.remove();sig()}};
  tt=setTimeout(rev,mit?2300:1400);ov.onclick=()=>{if(!hecho)rev()}};
 sig()}
